    612  f24e							;     clear -> enemy loop, no wall)
    613  f24e							; Results: solid -> A=2 wall contact via ReturnPad (caller resets the beam
    614  f24e							; to the eye); clear -> jmp LaserClampDone = enemy loop (0/$50/1).
